OL,3,AMissing teen hiker found dead in
OL,4,AAustralian bush after eight-day search
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a woman has been found in
OL,7,FAustralian bushland, following an
OL,8,Feight-day search for a Sydney teenager
OL,9,Freported missing last Wednesday.
OL,11,FPolice said that while the body was yet
OL,12,Fto be formally identified, it was
OL,13,Fbelieved to be that of 18-year-old Lily
OL,14,FHooper. The confirmation came after the
OL,15,Fstate premier told the New South Wales
OL,16,Fparliament that she had been found
OL,17,Falive before later retracting the
OL,18,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
