OL,3,AMissing teen hiker found dead in
OL,4,AAustralian bush after eight-day search
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe teenager left her home in Sydney to
OL,7,Fgo walking in a nearby national park on
OL,8,F12 August. Her family reported her
OL,9,Fmissing later that night, after she
OL,10,Ffailed to return home by 10pm.
OL,12,FHer car was found in a car park at the
OL,13,Fbottom of a challenging trail in the
OL,14,FNattai National Park.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
